WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.004 --> 00:00:19.286
band played as two large, masked creatures jumped onto the stage.

2
00:00:20.347 --> 00:00:23.228
One looked like a scary lion made of straw.

3
00:00:24.349 --> 00:00:29.012
The other had long hair, bulging eyes, and pointy fingernails.

4
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.321
"What is this dance about?"

5
00:00:32.941 --> 00:00:33.642
asked Mandy.

6
00:00:33.662 --> 00:00:38.524
"This is a story of good and evil," explained Nyoman.

7
00:00:38.544 --> 00:00:43.307
"The lion protects his people and land from an evil spirit."

8
00:00:44.507 --> 00:00:47.729
She pointed to the two dancers in strange costumes.

9
00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.211
Mandy clapped her hands excitedly.

10
00:00:52.332 --> 00:00:54.913
She was scared and amazed at the same time.

11
00:00:56.034 --> 00:01:00.116
On the other side of the crowd, Vinnie was watching the dance too.

12
00:01:01.896 --> 00:01:04.197
"Cool!" he kept saying.

13
00:01:04.217 --> 00:01:06.697
"Look at that mask!"

14
00:01:06.717 --> 00:01:13.599
"Watch the lion's helpers," said Wayan as men in checkered clothes jumped out.

15
00:01:13.619 --> 00:01:16.480
"They have knives!"

16
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:17.800
shouted Vinnie.

17
00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:23.882
"Yes. The evil spirit will soon put a spell on them," said Wayan.

18
00:01:25.102 --> 00:01:29.543
Vinnie noticed Mandy in the crowd with Nyoman and her family.

19
00:01:29.564 --> 00:01:32.597
"Hey! There's my sister!"

20
00:01:33.177 --> 00:01:34.997
he shouted and ran over.

21
00:01:35.018 --> 00:01:38.519
"Where have you been?"

22
00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:39.619
she asked.

23
00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:43.821
"It's a long story," said Vinnie.

24
00:01:44.861 --> 00:01:47.302
He told her about the rumbling volcano.

25
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:49.023
The dance ended.

26
00:01:50.024 --> 00:01:54.185
People began to leave the village center, walking in happy groups.

27
00:01:55.366 --> 00:01:57.707
Wayan came over to Vinnie and Mandy.

28
00:01:57.727 --> 00:02:01.984
"We'll make our offerings now," said Wayan.

29
00:02:02.004 --> 00:02:04.305
"Where is the temple?"

30
00:02:04.885 --> 00:02:05.605
asked Mandy.

31
00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:10.146
"It's on the slopes of that mountain," said Nyoman.

32
00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:13.947
"It is the most important temple in all of Bali.

33
00:02:14.988 --> 00:02:17.028
We call it the Mother Temple."

34
00:02:17.048 --> 00:02:22.290
"It's the only temple anyone can enter," added Wayan.

35
00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:24.410
"What do you mean?"

36
00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:25.791
asked Mandy.

37
00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:32.381
"You have to belong to a special group to worship at other temples," explained Nyoman.

38
00:02:32.401 --> 00:02:36.044
"At Mother Temple, everyone is welcome."

39
00:02:36.064 --> 00:02:43.949
"I don't know if it's a good idea to go there," said Vinnie, remembering the shaking ground.

40
00:02:43.969 --> 00:02:48.052
"We are not afraid of the mountain god," said Wayan.

41
00:02:48.072 --> 00:02:51.915
"The Mother Temple protects us from his rumblings."

42
00:02:53.636 --> 00:02:54.456
Vinnie stopped.

43
00:02:54.476 --> 00:03:01.153
"I don't want to go up there again, Mandy," he whispered, grabbing his sister's arm.

44
00:03:01.173 --> 00:03:03.455
"It's a volcano!"

45
00:03:04.576 --> 00:03:07.598
Mandy suddenly gasped as she stared ahead.

46
00:03:08.979 --> 00:03:11.841
On the slope of the mountain was a large temple.

47
00:03:13.302 --> 00:03:15.884
The village people were all heading toward it.

48
00:03:15.904 --> 00:03:18.486
"Vinnie, look!"

49
00:03:19.106 --> 00:03:20.927
Mandy pulled the photo out.

50
00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:23.289
It was glowing blue.

51
00:03:23.309 --> 00:03:27.112
"We're in the right place," Vinnie said.

52
00:03:28.268 --> 00:03:30.189
"But what's everyone holding?"

53
00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:32.570
"Mandy! Vinnie!

54
00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.471
Come on," Nyoman called to them.

55
00:03:35.491 --> 00:03:38.532
"We must take our offerings to the gods."

56
00:03:39.233 --> 00:03:40.933
She quickly walked on ahead.

57
00:03:40.953 --> 00:03:43.034
"What's in their hands?"

58
00:03:43.674 --> 00:03:44.715
Vinnie asked again.

59
00:03:46.255 --> 00:03:50.157
As they got closer, they saw people walking up the steps.

60
00:03:51.418 --> 00:03:53.598
Everyone held something in their hands.

61
00:03:54.779 --> 00:03:57.040
Mandy looked at the photo and smiled.

62
00:03:58.088 --> 00:04:00.509
The offerings in the photo were glowing red.

63
00:04:00.529 --> 00:04:04.430
"Flowers," Mandy said, pointing.

64
00:04:05.931 --> 00:04:09.412
Everyone was holding flowers wrapped in coconut leaves.

65
00:04:10.732 --> 00:04:14.194
Suddenly the children were blinded by the bright light.

66
00:04:15.534 --> 00:04:20.636
They fell down the dark tunnel and landed with a thump in the attic.
